----- 02-examples -----

Here are some examples of locations using EPSG-REFs. Please note that there are too
many EPSG-REFs to list here, and you can see the full list at:

  https://crs-explorer.proj.org/
  https://spatialreference.org/

------------------------------------

Just as a matter of interest, we have also included MGRS, Open Location Plus Codes,
and Local and International Mapcodes for that location. To find out more:

MGRS:
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Military_Grid_Reference_System

Open Location Plus Codes:
https://maps.google.com/pluscodes/

Mapcodes:
https://www.mapcode.com/en/

